                                                "sense_id": "45b732d5-95bb-36b7-95cf-97e2f5fa1595",
                                                "text": "\"Marnie?\" she said slowly, reading the name on the cover. \"But how did you know? Marian was always called Marnie-\" ( - - - )\n\"She was called Marianna,\" Gillie said, \"after her great-grandmother. Marnie was so pleased about that! And of course it is a lovely name. It had a Spanish sound about it too, which pleased the father.\""
